# Agent Hierarchy

When creating or reorganizing skills, rules, or agent docs under `.cursor/`:

- Prefer **deepening** (flat `references/*.md`) over new sibling skills.
- Tiers by cost: always-on rule → glob rule → `SKILL.md` → `references/` → `assets/`. Keep `references/` one level deep — no subfolders.
- Load `.cursor/skills/ai-agent/hierarchy/SKILL.md` for the full decision. Project-local context uses the `AGENT.md` chain (outside this glob).
- Nesting/retrieval still come from `foundations/hierarchy`.
